File Index

/dsl-questions.example.json
Purpose: Tracked, plain-JSON starter template (3 obviously-fake Q&A) for the operator to copy to <DATA_DIR>/dsl-questions.json and replace with real questions.

/jest.config.cjs
Purpose: Self-contained node jest config; maps types-server to its TS source so tests don't need a prior build.

/package.json
Purpose: Express-based auth service package (port 62000); scripts include temp-password/register-service/revoke-service-key host-run CLIs.

/tsconfig.json
Purpose: NodeNext build config mirroring mud-builder-server.
